### create coupon fixed
POST {{baseurl}}/coupons/create
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "SHOPFLOW20",
  "discountValue": 20.00,
  "discountType": "FIXED",
  "minPurchaseValue": 100.00,
  "expirationDate": "2027-12-31T23:59:59",
  "maxUses": 50,
  "active": "true"
}

### create coupon percentage
POST {{baseurl}}/coupons/create
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "PROMO10",
  "discountValue": 10.00,
  "discountType": "PERCENTAGE",
  "minPurchaseValue": 0.00,
  "expirationDate": "2027-12-31T23:59:59",
  "maxUses": 0,
  "active": "true"
}

### search coupons
GET {{baseurl}}/coupons/search
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### validate coupons
GET {{baseurl}}/coupons/validate?code=PROMO10&cartTotal=150.00
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

